<section class="content-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div class="col-md-8 indent-right mb-big-sm">
        <h3 data-aos="fade-right" class="aos-init aos-animate">Who We Are</h3>
        <div data-aos="fade-right" class="textbox aos-init aos-animate"><p>At Aquatech, we tackle the challenges of water scarcity and complexity by leveraging technology, expertise, and financing to deliver comprehensive solutions that reduce carbon and recycled water footprint.&nbsp;</p>

<p>As a leading global provider of water and process technology solutions, we help the world's most recognized companies achieve their sustainability and operational goals by implementing innovative approaches for water reuse, desalination, minimal and zero liquid discharge, and critical minerals recovery.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Our work catalyzes the transition toward a more sustainable future and showcases our commitment to addressing water's role in climate adaptation.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
</div>
      </div>
      <div class="col-md-4">
        <nav data-aos="fade-left" class="side-nav-wrap options-menu aos-init aos-animate">
          <div class="item">
  <a href="#"><span class="fas fa-fw fa-download"></span>Interview: Aquatech's Journey from Regional to Global Leader</a>
</div>

<div class="item">
  <a href="#"><span class="fas fa-fw fa-download"></span>Podcast: What Sparks Growth at Aquatech</a>
</div>

<div class="item">
  <a href="#"><span class="fas fa-fw fa-download"></span>Interview: Our Views On Climate Adaptation</a>
</div>


        </nav>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="illustrated-section content-section  ">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div data-aos="fade-right" class="col-md-6 indent-right aos-init aos-animate">
        <div class="image-wrap  "><img class="" src="/assets-f/img/3795ca964dcf6a.svg">

        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-aos="fade-left" class="col-md-6 aos-init aos-animate">
        <h2 class="h3">Pioneering Sustainable Solutions</h2>
        <div class="textbox mb"><p>Aquatech was established in 1981 in Canonsburg, Pennsylvania, USA. Aquatech has offices throughout the US, and has a significant presence worldwide through offices in India, Europe, the Middle East, and China.&nbsp;</p>

<p>Through its network and worldwide operations, Aquatech has successfully executed more than 2,000 site solutions in over 60 countries around the globe.&nbsp;</p>
</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="illustrated-section content-section  image-right">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="row">
      <div data-aos="fade-left" class="col-md-6 indent-left aos-init aos-animate">
        <div class="image-wrap  "><img class="" src="/assets-f/img/d9bb90501cabf4.svg">

        </div>
      </div>
      <div data-aos="fade-right" class="col-md-6 aos-init aos-animate">
        <h2 class="h3">Guiding the Shift Towards Sustainability</h2>
        <div class="textbox mb"><p>We leverage our significant experience of 43+ years to focus on solving our customer’s challenges with an unwavering commitment to our phrase “<em><strong>From Innovation Flows Leadership</strong></em>.”&nbsp;</p>

<p>Aquatech is dedicated to solving water and resource challenges with a focus on delivering cutting-edge technologies and processes tailored to address distinct project challenges, meet industry-specific demands, enhance system efficiency and dependability, and substantially minimize both installation time and expenses.&nbsp;</p>
</div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

